    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Audience Counts",
      "Anchor": "audience-counts",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts"
      ],
      "Text": "The audienceCounts API allows you to forecast reach based on targeting criteria.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "The following request returns estimated audience counts for Canada and USA while excluding members who are in entry-level positions.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "http\n\n\ncurl",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/rest/audienceCounts?q=targetingCriteria\u0026target.includedTargetingFacets.locations[0]=urn:li:geo:101174742\u0026target.includedTargetingFacets.locations[1]=urn:li:geo:103644278\u0026target.excludingTargetingFacets.seniorities[0]=urn:li:seniority:3",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "curl -X GET \u0027https://api.linkedin.com/rest/audienceCounts?q=targetingCriteria\u0026target.includedTargetingFacets.locations[0]=urn:li:geo:101174742\u0026target.includedTargetingFacets.locations[1]=urn:li:geo:103644278\u0026target.excludingTargetingFacets.seniorities[0]=urn:li:seniority:3\u0027 \\\n-H \u0027Authorization: Bearer {INSERT_TOKEN}\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n    \u0022elements\u0022: [\n        {\n            \u0022active\u0022: 0,\n            \u0022total\u0022: 150000000\n        }\n    ],\n    \u0022paging\u0022: {\n        \u0022count\u0022: 10,\n        \u0022links\u0022: [],\n        \u0022start\u0022: 0\n    }\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Audience Counts",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "See the targetingFacets reference page to learn more about targetingFacets and Audience Counts for more information on the Audience Counts API.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Ad Budget Pricing",
      "Anchor": "ad-budget-pricing",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Budget Pricing"
      ],
      "Text": "With the adBudgetPricing API, you can get key insights on pricing metrics such as minimum, maximum, and suggested bids based on targeting criteria. The sample request returns pricing for an account based on target market criteria.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Budget Pricing",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "In the following example, the target market consists of LinkedIn members between the ages of 18 and 24.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Budget Pricing",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "http\n\n\ncurl",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Budget Pricing",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/rest/adBudgetPricing?account=urn:li:sponsoredAccount:1245678\u0026bidType=CPM\u0026campaignType=SPONSORED_INMAILS\u0026matchType=EXACT\u0026q=criteria\u0026target.includedTargetingFacets.ageRanges[0]=AGE_18_24",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Budget Pricing",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "curl -X GET \u0027https://api.linkedin.com/rest/adBudgetPricing?account=urn:li:sponsoredAccount:1245678\u0026bidType=CPM\u0026campaignType=SPONSORED_INMAILS\u0026matchType=EXACT\u0026q=criteria\u0026target.includedTargetingFacets.ageRanges[0]=AGE_18_24\u0027 \\\n-H \u0027Authorization: Bearer {INSERT_TOKEN}\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Budget Pricing",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n    \u0022elements\u0022: [\n        {\n            \u0022maxBid\u0022: {\n                \u0022amount\u0022: \u0022100.0\u0022,\n                \u0022currencyCode\u0022: \u0022USD\u0022\n            },\n            \u0022minBid\u0022: {\n                \u0022amount\u0022: \u00220.3\u0022,\n                \u0022currencyCode\u0022: \u0022USD\u0022\n            },\n            \u0022suggestedBid\u0022: {\n                \u0022amount\u0022: \u00222.06\u0022,\n                \u0022currencyCode\u0022: \u0022USD\u0022\n            },\n            \u0022suggestedBidRangeHighEnd\u0022: {\n                \u0022amount\u0022: \u00222.11\u0022,\n                \u0022currencyCode\u0022: \u0022USD\u0022\n            },\n            \u0022suggestedBidRangeLowEnd\u0022: {\n                \u0022amount\u0022: \u00222.01\u0022,\n                \u0022currencyCode\u0022: \u0022USD\u0022\n            }\n        }\n    ],\n    \u0022paging\u0022: {\n        \u0022count\u0022: 10,\n        \u0022links\u0022: [],\n        \u0022start\u0022: 0\n    }\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response-1",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Budget Pricing",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "See the targetingFacets reference page to learn more about targetingFacets and Ad Budget Pricing for more information on the Ad Budget Pricing API.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Ad Supply Forecasts",
      "Anchor": "ad-supply-forecasts",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Supply Forecasts"
      ],
      "Text": "The adSupplyForecasts API provides a forecast of the reach, cost, and supply for an ad using specified targeting criteria.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-2",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Supply Forecasts",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "The following sample request forecasts the impressions of a sponsored update for Canada and USA while excluding members in entry-level positions.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-2",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Supply Forecasts",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "http\n\n\ncurl",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-2",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Supply Forecasts",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/rest/adSupplyForecasts?q=criteria\u0026timeRange.start=1464804127000\u0026timeRange.end=1465581727000\u0026target.includedTargetingFacets.locations[0]=urn:li:geo:101174742\u0026target.includedTargetingFacets.locations[1]=urn:li:geo:103644278\u0026target.excludingTargetingFacets.seniorities[0]=urn:li:seniority:3\u0026campaignType=SPONSORED_UPDATES\u0026competingBid.bidType=CPM\u0026competingBid.bidPrice.currencyCode=USD\u0026competingBid.bidPrice.amount=10",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-2",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Supply Forecasts",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "curl -X GET \u0027https://api.linkedin.com/rest/adSupplyForecasts?q=criteria\u0026timeRange.start=1464804127000\u0026timeRange.end=1465581727000\u0026target.includedTargetingFacets.locations[0]=urn:li:geo:101174742\u0026target.includedTargetingFacets.locations[1]=urn:li:geo:103644278\u0026target.excludingTargetingFacets.seniorities[0]=urn:li:seniority:3\u0026campaignType=SPONSORED_UPDATES\u0026competingBid.bidType=CPM\u0026competingBid.bidPrice.currencyCode=USD\u0026competingBid.bidPrice.amount=10\u0027 \\\n-H \u0027Authorization: Bearer {INSERT_TOKEN}\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response-2",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Supply Forecasts",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n  \u0022elements\u0022: [\n    {\n      \u0022timeSeries\u0022: [\n        {\n          \u0022value\u0022: 22874,\n          \u0022timestamp\u0022: 1485302400000\n        },\n        {\n          \u0022value\u0022: 2244802,\n          \u0022timestamp\u0022: 1485388800000\n        },\n        {\n          \u0022value\u0022: 1869223,\n          \u0022timestamp\u0022: 1485475200000\n        },\n        {\n          \u0022value\u0022: 1098326,\n          \u0022timestamp\u0022: 1485561600000\n        },\n        ...\n     ],\n     \u0022metricType\u0022: \u0022IMPRESSION\u0022,\n      \u0022granularity\u0022: \u0022DAILY\u0022\n    }\n  ],\n  \u0022paging\u0022: {\n    \u0022count\u0022: 10,\n    \u0022start\u0022: 0,\n    \u0022links\u0022: []\n  }\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response-2",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Supply Forecasts",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "For more information on the Ad Supply Forecasts API, check out Ad Supply Forecasts.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Suggested Targeting Options",
      "Anchor": "suggested-targeting-options",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Suggested Targeting Options"
      ],
      "Text": "The LinkedIn Ads platform allows you to reach a wide range of audiences based on unique targeting criteria. The Ad Targeting Similar Entities finder suggests additional targeting attributes based on a provided target set.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-3",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Suggested Targeting Options",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "The following example returns industries similar to Biotechnology, urn:li:industry:12.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-3",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Suggested Targeting Options",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "http\n\n\ncurl",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-3",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Suggested Targeting Options",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "https://api.linkedin.com/rest/adTargetingEntities?q=similarEntities\u0026facet=urn:li:adTargetingFacet:industries\u0026entityType=INDUSTRY\u0026entities=urn:li:industry:12\u0026fields=value,name,facetUrn,urn",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request-3",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Suggested Targeting Options",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "curl -X GET \u0027https://api.linkedin.com/rest/adTargetingEntities?q=similarEntities\u0026facet=urn:li:adTargetingFacet:industries\u0026entityType=INDUSTRY\u0026entities=urn:li:industry:12\u0026fields=value,name,facetUrn,urn\u0027 \\\n-H \u0027Authorization: Bearer {INSERT_TOKEN}\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response-3",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Suggested Targeting Options",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n  \u0022elements\u0022: [\n    {\n      \u0022value\u0022: {\n        \u0022string\u0022: \u0022urn:li:industry:15\u0022,\n        \u0022string~\u0022: {\n          \u0022name\u0022: {\n            \u0022localized\u0022: {\n              \u0022en_US\u0022: \u0022Pharmaceuticals\u0022\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \u0022value\u0022: {\n        \u0022string\u0022: \u0022urn:li:industry:17\u0022,\n        \u0022string~\u0022: {\n          \u0022name\u0022: {\n            \u0022localized\u0022: {\n              \u0022en_US\u0022: \u0022Medical Device\u0022\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \u0022value\u0022: {\n        \u0022string\u0022: \u0022urn:li:industry:13\u0022,\n        \u0022string~\u0022: {\n          \u0022name\u0022: {\n            \u0022localized\u0022: {\n              \u0022en_US\u0022: \u0022Medical Practice\u0022\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    ...\n  ]\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Response",
      "Anchor": "sample-response-3",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Suggested Targeting Options",
        "Sample Response"
      ],
      "Text": "To learn more about Targeting by Similar Entities, see the Ad Targeting page.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Updating a Share with UTM Tracking Parameters",
      "Anchor": "updating-a-share-with-utm-tracking-parameters",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Updating a Share with UTM Tracking Parameters"
      ],
      "Text": "URLs in shares can be updated to include UTM parameters for advertisers to track the success of marketing efforts and prove ROI. This feature allows retroactive modification of URLs contained within shares.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Updating a Share with UTM Tracking Parameters",
      "Anchor": "updating-a-share-with-utm-tracking-parameters",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Updating a Share with UTM Tracking Parameters"
      ],
      "Text": "To update UTM parameters, you must know the share URN and content of the share. For more information on how to leverage this feature, see UTM Tracking.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Updating a Share with UTM Tracking Parameters",
      "Anchor": "updating-a-share-with-utm-tracking-parameters",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Updating a Share with UTM Tracking Parameters"
      ],
      "Text": "http\n\n\ncurl",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Updating a Share with UTM Tracking Parameters",
      "Anchor": "updating-a-share-with-utm-tracking-parameters",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Updating a Share with UTM Tracking Parameters"
      ],
      "Text": "POST https://api.linkedin.com/rest/sharesUrl/{shareURN}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Updating a Share with UTM Tracking Parameters",
      "Anchor": "updating-a-share-with-utm-tracking-parameters",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Updating a Share with UTM Tracking Parameters"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n    \u0022patch\u0022: {\n        \u0022content\u0022: {\n            \u0022$set\u0022: {\n                \u0022contentEntities\u0022: [\n                    {\n                        \u0022description\u0022: \u0022News, email and search are just the beginning. Discover more every day. Find your yodel.\u0022,\n                        \u0022entity\u0022: \u0022urn:li:article:8302773461016502828\u0022,\n                        \u0022entityLocation\u0022: \u0022https://www.yahoo.com?utm_campaign=blogpost\u0026utm_medium=social\u0026utm_source=facebook\u0022,\n                        \u0022thumbnails\u0022: [\n                            {\n                                \u0022imageSpecificContent\u0022: {\n                                    \u0022height\u0022: 200,\n                                    \u0022size\u0022: 5992,\n                                    \u0022width\u0022: 200\n                                },\n                                \u0022resolvedUrl\u0022: \u0022https://s.yimg.com/dh/ap/default/130909/y_200_a.png\u0022\n                            }\n                        ],\n                        \u0022title\u0022: \u0022Test Share with Content !!\u0022\n                    }\n                ]\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Updating a Share with UTM Tracking Parameters",
      "Anchor": "updating-a-share-with-utm-tracking-parameters",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Updating a Share with UTM Tracking Parameters"
      ],
      "Text": "curl -X POST \u0027https://api.linkedin.com/rest/sharesUrl/{shareURN}\u0027 \\\n-H \u0027Authorization: Bearer {INSERT_TOKEN}\u0027 \\\n-H \u0027Content-Type: application/json\u0027 \\\n--data \u0027{\n    \u0022patch\u0022: {\n        \u0022content\u0022: {\n            \u0022$set\u0022: {\n                \u0022contentEntities\u0022: [\n                    {\n                        \u0022description\u0022: \u0022News, email and search are just the beginning. Discover more every day. Find your yodel.\u0022,\n                        \u0022entity\u0022: \u0022urn:li:article:8302773461016502828\u0022,\n                        \u0022entityLocation\u0022: \u0022https://www.yahoo.com?utm_campaign=blogpost\u0026utm_medium=social\u0026utm_source=facebook\u0022,\n                        \u0022thumbnails\u0022: [\n                            {\n                                \u0022imageSpecificContent\u0022: {\n                                    \u0022height\u0022: 200,\n                                    \u0022size\u0022: 5992,\n                                    \u0022width\u0022: 200\n                                },\n                                \u0022resolvedUrl\u0022: \u0022https://s.yimg.com/dh/ap/default/130909/y_200_a.png\u0022\n                            }\n                        ],\n                        \u0022title\u0022: \u0022Test Share with Content !!\u0022\n                    }\n                ]\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Ad Analytics",
      "Anchor": "ad-analytics",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Ad Analytics"
      ],
      "Text": "The Ad Analytics API provides account, campaign, and creative level statistics on current spend as well as chargeable clicks and impressions. To learn more, see Reporting.",
